<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 552.97, down 3.16.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 321 to 191.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.07.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,001,380 compared with 17,991,435 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
